Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10.9 Update name -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{catA.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hot Beverages" }

### 10.10 Empty update body -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{catA.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 10.11 Reorder (paste the ids from 10.6, swapped) -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": ["e4366a2b-b9ac-4ef3-ac6d-b96311d6f820", "c17bbb60-65b2-4fc8-b3fc-7619d39edab4"] }

### 10.12 Reorder with duplicate ids -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": ["e4366a2b-b9ac-4ef3-ac6d-b96311d6f820", "c17bbb60-65b2-4fc8-b3fc-7619d39edab4"] }

### 10.13 Reorder with unknown id -> 404 (and nothing changes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": ["e4366a2b-b9ac-4ef3-ac6d-b96311d6f820", "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"] }

### 10.14 Delete -> 200 (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/{{catA.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10.15 No token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
