### 11. TENANT ISOLATION (the most important tests)
### Login as owner2 (restaurant B) and put his token in @tokenB.
### CAT_A_ID = a category id that belongs to restaurant A.
### EVERYTHING below must answer 404, never 200/403.
### =====================================================================
@tokenB = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI0YzYwMGUzNi1mMjQwLTRjZmEtYTkyZC00ZjM1MjhiZTJhMTgiLCJzaWQiOiIzMWUzYzc1MS01NjNlLTQ3Y2MtYjc5Zi1hMDI4ZGM4NDhkNzciLCJpYXQiOjE3OTMyMzU0NTksImV4cCI6MTc5MzIzNjM1OX0.JaFDxgi2moYfb97OiXTkV6HhBphIV-zIfpJhN2Lb5EY
@catAId = c17bbb60-65b2-4fc8-b3fc-7619d39edab4

