### =====================================================================
### 12. MENU ITEMS (restaurant A = owner1)
### =====================================================================
@catId = PASTE_A_CATEGORY_ID_OF_RESTAURANT_A

### 12.1 Create -> 201 (price is a NUMBER, no restaurant_id in response)
# @name itemA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category_id": "{{catId}}", "title": "Latte", "description": "Milk + espresso", "price": 55.5 }

### 12.2 Same title in same category, different case -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category_id": "{{catId}}", "title": "latte", "price": 10 }

### 12.3 Injection attempts: restaurant_id / image_url / display_order -> 400 (strict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category_id": "{{catId}}", "title": "Hack", "price": 1, "image_url": "https://evil.com/x.png" }

### 12.4 Bad price: negative / 3 decimals / string -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menu-items
