### 18. RESTAURANT DETAILS
### 18.1 Full update -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "أفضل قهوة في المدينة",
  "phone": "+20 100 123 4567",
  "whatsapp": "01001234567",
  "address": "12 شارع التحرير، الجيزة",
  "maps_url": "https://maps.google.com/?q=30.0131,31.2089",
  "instagram_url": "https://instagram.com/testcafe",
  "currency": "egp",
  "working_hours": {
    "sat": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "sun": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "mon": null,
    "tue": { "open": "18:00", "close": "02:00" },
    "wed": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "thu": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "fri": { "open": "14:00", "close": "23:00" }
  }
}

### 18.2 Clear a field with null -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "instagram_url": null }

### 18.3 Bad values -> 400 (one request per case)
# { "phone": "abc" }  |  { "maps_url": "http://insecure.com" }  |  { "maps_url": "javascript:alert(1)" }
# { "currency": "EGPP" }  |  { "timezone": "Mars/Base" }  |  { "address": "" }
# working_hours with a missing day, "25:00", or open == close

### 18.4 Try slug / logo_url / status / subscription_ends_at -> 400 (strict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "active" }

### 18.5 Editor -> 403
### 18.6 Public menu shows the new fields (and NO status / id / subscription_ends_at)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/menu/test-cafe-1
### =====================================================================
### 15. STAFF MANAGEMENT
### @token = owner1 (Admin A) | @tokenEditor = editor1 | @tokenViewer = user1 | @tokenB = caseuser (Admin B)
### =====================================================================
@tokenEditor = PASTE_TOKEN_OF_EDITOR1
@tokenViewer = PASTE_TOKEN_OF_USER1
@adminId = PASTE_ID_OF_OWNER1_FROM_GET_API_USER

### 15.1 Admin lists staff -> 200: admin first, then editor, then viewer. No password_hash, no restaurant_id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15.2 Editor lists staff -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEditor}}

### 15.3 Viewer lists staff -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenViewer}}

### 15.4 Editor tries to add a staff member -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEditor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sneaky", "email": "sneaky@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "1984" }

### 15.5 Admin adds an Editor -> 201
# @name newStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "editor two", "email": "editor2@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "1984" }

### 15.6 Duplicate email (any case) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "another name", "email": "EDITOR2@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "2001" }

### 15.7 Duplicate username in the same restaurant -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "editor two", "email": "other@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "2001" }

### 15.8 Try to create an Admin -> 400 (enum allows 1984 / 2001 only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "second admin", "email": "admin2@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "5150" }

### 15.9 Inject restaurant_id -> 400 (strict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "x user", "email": "x@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "1984", "restaurant_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000" }

### 15.10 Weak password -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "weak user", "email": "weak2@test.com", "password": "123", "roles": "2001" }

### 15.11 Change the new staff role Editor -> Viewer -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{newStaff.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": "2001" }

### 15.12 Change role to Admin -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{newStaff.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": "5150" }

### 15.13 Admin changes HIS OWN role -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": "2001" }

### 15.14 Admin deletes HIMSELF -> 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15.15 Invalid uuid -> 400
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15.16 Delete the new staff member -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{newStaff.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15.17 Delete him again -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{newStaff.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =====================================================================
### 16. TENANT ISOLATION for staff (B = caseuser). Everything must be 404
### =====================================================================
@staffAId = PASTE_ID_OF_editor1_FROM_15.1

### 16.1 B lists staff -> 200, must show ONLY caseuser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### 16.2 B changes A's staff role -> 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roles": "2001" }

### 16.3 B deletes A's staff -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### 16.4 B creates staff -> 201, and he belongs to B (check GET 16.1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "editor two", "email": "editorb@test.com", "password": "Passw0rd!123", "roles": "1984" }


### 17. RESTAURANT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17.2 Update name -> 200 (slug unchanged)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Cafe Updated" }

### 17.3 Try to change slug -> 400 (strict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "new-slug" }

### 17.4 Editor / Viewer edit -> 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEditor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hacked" }

### 17.5 Upload logo -> 200 (restaurants/<id>/logo), then GET /api/public/menu/test-cafe-1 shows it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test.png
------Boundary--

### 17.6 Delete logo -> 200, again -> 400
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurant/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}